  "job_B3.2.39_20251003_114635": {
    "text": "Spel to \u00f0am o\u00f0rum gangd\u00e6ge.\nGirsand\u00e6g we w\u00e6ron manode, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feissa haligra daga bigangnes.\nLiornodon we \u00fe\u00e6t geo h\u00e6\u00f0ene liode h\u00e6fdon \u00fery dagas synderlice beforan hira o\u00f0rum gewunan \u00fe\u00e6t hie\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s dioflum sylfum, for \u00feon \u00fee hie hira godu h\u00e6fdon geworhte of treowum & of stanum & of\n\u00d0onne to \u00f0am onlicnessum swylcum hie onluton & \u00feam lac onsendan, \u00feonne eode \u00fe\u00e6t dioful in on \u00fea\n\u00deonne tealdon men \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re God sylfa.\nW\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne \u00fea wyrrestan helle g\u00e6stas, nalas God sylfa, \u00e6lmihtig eallra gesceafta scippend.\n\u00deonne wi\u00f0 \u00feon gesette us sanctus Petrus sy\u00f0\u00fean & o\u00f0erra cyricena ealdormen \u00fea halgan gangdagas \u00fery,\n& we sculon beran usse reliquias ymb ure land, \u00fea medeman Cristes rodetacen \u00fee we Cristes m\u00e6l\nSwelce we sculon beran \u00f0a bec \u00fee man hate\u00f0 godspel, on \u00feam syndon awritene \u00fea halgan & \u00fea\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t ilce f\u00e6sten \u00fee we nu foran to Eastrum f\u00e6sta\u00f0.\n\u00deurh \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten dryhten diofles miht abr\u00e6c & his costunga oferswi\u00f0de & mancynne ecne sige forgeaf,\nIs \u00f0\u00e6r on \u00feam bocum awriten sio halige Cristes \u00ferowung & his \u00e6riste & his upastignesse & his worda\nEac we sculon beran o\u00f0re halige reliquias, \u00fe\u00e6t syndon haligra manna lafe, hyra feaxes o\u00f0\u00f0e hyra lices\n& urne ceap & urne eard & urne wudu & eal ure god we sculon Gode bebeodan, & him \u00feancian \u00feara\nHergen we ealra \u00feinga & wuldrigen we \u00e6rest \u00e6lmihtigne God & his \u00feone acendan sunu & \u00feone halgan\n& we wior\u00f0ian his \u00fea halgan ealle & us to \u00f0am mundbyrden geornlice, & wilnigan we hiora miltse, ge\nSwa Dauid hit on sealmum sang & \u00feus cw\u00e6d: Nimis honorati sunt amici tui, Deus; nimis confortatus\nHer hie syndon swi\u00f0e mihtige \u00feam to fultumigenne \u00fee hine nu giornlice in \u00feysse worulde gemuna\u00fe.\nUton bion gemyndige \u00fe\u00e6t us hafa\u00f0 God gehaten \u00fe\u00e6t he wile in \u00fe\u00e6re gesamnunge bion \u00fee for his naman\n\u00deus he sylfa on his godspelle cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ubi sunt duo uel tres congregati in nomine meo, ibi sum ego in\nWe \u00feonne syndon nu gesamnode.\nWe gelyfa\u00f0 in dryhtnes naman.\nHe is us betweonum on andweardnesse.\nMen \u00fea leofestan, we sculon habban mycelne egesan to ussum \u00feam heofonlican hlaforde, se \u00f0e us\nBe \u00f0am dryhtnes egesan hit is \u00f0us cweden: Initium sapienti\u00eb timor domini, Snyttro fruma is dryhtnes\nOf \u00f0am dryhtnes egesan us wior\u00f0e\u00f0 acenned hiortan onbyrdnes.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re onbyrdnesse ea\u00f0modnes bi\u00f0 acenned.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re ea\u00f0modnesse licumlice lustas & ealle uncysta wior\u00f0 ut awyrtrumade.\n& ealle gastlice m\u00e6genu sceolon for\u00f0weaxan of dryhtnes egesan.\nMid \u00feam egesan we us geceapia\u00f0 heofenlicu \u00feing, englas for mannum, lif for dea\u00f0e, god for yfele,\nGif we wilnigan rixian mid Criste, bebigen we \u00f0a woruldcundan lustas for undea\u00f0licnesse.\n& don we symle eal \u00feas \u00feing mid dryhtnes egesan.\nSe egesa us gel\u00e6de\u00f0 fram helwarum, & he us onfeh\u00f0 to \u00feam uplican rice, & he drife\u00f0 fram us \u00e6lce\nHe is se egesa.\nIntellectus bonus omnibus facientibus ea.\nLaudatio eius manet in seculum seculi.\nTimentibus dominum non deficient omni bono.\nGod ongitet ealle \u00fea \u00fee hine willa\u00f0, & \u00fe\u00e6s hyrnesse \u00fee hine beganga\u00f0 wuna\u00f0 in worulda wuruld.\n\u00dea men \u00fee him dryhten ondr\u00e6da\u00f0, ne springa\u00fe hie fram \u00e6negum gode.\nNu we gehyrdon, men \u00f0a leofestan, hu god is \u00fe\u00e6t we h\u00e6bben dryhtnes egesan.\nSecan we symle mid ondrysnum egesan \u00fea halgan reliquias dryhtnes & \u00feyllicre gesamnunge.\n& \u00feonne huru getilien we \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00feonne \u00f0a halgan lare godspelles gehyren \u00fe\u00e6t hio f\u00e6ste wunige on\n& we eac l\u00e6ren o\u00f0re men, \u00feonne hie to us cymen, \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00f0onne ealle \u00fee selran sien, ge onwearde ge\n& \u00fea so\u00f0an lufan Godes & manna eorne healden we arwior\u00f0lice eallum tidum usses lifes.\nGif we \u00f0us don willa\u00f0, \u00feonne geearnige we us Godes miltse & blisse, & \u00e6fter \u00feysse worulde ece are &",
